    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d273">

                <pb facs="0423" n="376" sameAs="frus:frus1955-57v03mSupp/pg376"/>

                <head>273. Telegram 852 to Geneva<anchor n="1" xml:id="d273-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1955-10-07">October 7, 1955, 8:34
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <pb facs="d273-1" n="1" type="facsimile" xml:id="d273-1"/>
                <p>852. For Johnson.</p>
                <p>Your 819, para 13, cites 19 still in jail. Your despatch No. 1 of August 3 lists
                    25 in jail. Seven of these since released, making balance still in jail 18.
                    Comment.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">Dulles</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
